"Improved positioning and attitude performance in GNSS-contested environments"
msgstr "在 GNSS 受干扰环境中改善定位和姿态性能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:14
#: 1740950a1ffa419cb8235111049e7d81 8f387838443346608eb608b06c2d0dd4
#: 94026846f0014b0cba91016b02893560 a2f53f4b93e547e884e999281bf82468
#: c85d0b6f66f3447b8fb1a49a0e2e12d9
msgid ""
"Performance under challenging dynamic conditions (e.g. catapult launches, "
"VTOL operations, high-g or high angular rate operations)"
msgstr "在高动态条件下的性能（如弹射起飞、VTOL 操作、高过载或高角速率操作）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:16
#: 23439e163f9046ddaea73d8c84ccd1ac 2c9c66f2b4e74baebb7779533c0dcbf2
#: 6770e4338b6543e0bf0c157819a0e976 dd7ba7f7ac0b43fb8d43902c6afc3184
#: e5bacf6c9356431f84db5aa0c23281e9
msgid ""
"The VectorNav ArduPilot Driver is streamlined to provide a simple plug-and-"
"play architecture, removing engineering obstacles and allowing the "
"acceleration of the design, development, and launch of platforms to keep "
"pace with the rapid rate of innovation."
msgstr ""
"VectorNav ArduPilot 驱动程序经过优化，提供简单的即插即用架构，消除工程障碍，加速平台的设计、开发和推出，以跟上快速创新的步伐。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:18
#: 1dfdeb8944734efc854b8e6f676ae3aa 9ac0b1995d9f49b38551aba607dc77a0
#: b96d3f15c67043f7ae0651030ac218e6 d223dd5e831c468da95ee57004522e80
#: e49cfcff42a44c51ad043feacf836b8a
msgid ""
"ArduPilot can use these sensors as an :ref:`external AHRS <common-external-"
"ahrs>`, bypassing/replacing the EKF3 estimator, or as a source of raw sensor"
" data provided to the estimator."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 可将这些传感器用作 :ref:`外部 AHRS <common-external-ahrs>`，绕过/替代 EKF3 "
"估计器，或作为提供给估计器的原始传感器数据来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:20
#: 0bb1c942040c4b7cb02d8c0e0eafa01a 42d866fb4bcc444c89707fa03be8066a
#: 6a1845df1cac4bd1b30d70153c110f63 edf0ac8375984f5c95debeb826e7ad6d
#: f61c13e6c3184c298b40aeede2d345a6
msgid ""
"The driver supports `all VectorNav sensors "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/store/products>`__. In particular the following "
"systems are recommended:"
msgstr ""
"驱动程序支持 `所有 VectorNav 传感器 "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/store/products>`__。特别推荐以下系统："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:22
#: 0387099002a54dab837bd86f6cf1c3ee 22d0c9b92dad415682b755a7c1dc77e9
#: 3a0f00d3688b4c97ac17f6da94c36563 6b50eddfc8f74115a3cae064da4b1f31
#: 8c019307dbc74551b74db2f7a26ee2fe
msgid ""
"`VN-200 <https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-200>`__ or `VN-210 "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-210>`__ `GNSS/INS "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-"
"operation/theory-gpsins>`__: Recommended for fixed-wing systems without "
"hovering, where static heading is not necessary."
msgstr ""
"`VN-200 <https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-200>`__ 或 `VN-210 "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-210>`__ `GNSS/INS "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-"
"operation/theory-gpsins>`__：推荐用于无需悬停、不需要静态航向的固定翼系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:23
#: 189cf6a64e7d44819019b26d9abfa4ca 3968bb99c27e466e8cefc1a22f899bb3
#: 3c4ce79b31104c05823a3cd75d4c32a5 9209ac7695104295a19cdccb2c3bac7f
#: b1f0a606fe3f452f9636ad8b1a3a259b
msgid ""
"`VN-300 <https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-300>`__ or `VN-310 "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-310>`__ `Dual GNSS/INS "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-"
"operation/theory-gnsscompass>`__: Recommended for multicopter systems where "
"hovering and low dynamics requires the use of static heading."
msgstr ""
"`VN-300 <https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-300>`__ 或 `VN-310 "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/products/detail/vn-310>`__ `双 GNSS/INS "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/resources/inertial-navigation-primer/theory-of-"
"operation/theory-gnsscompass>`__：推荐用于需要悬停和低动态飞行、需使用静态航向的多旋翼系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:25
#: 082e3198c01241469124518de0873862 2480333f37734d4cada3afc9ad6b58bd
#: 2ab633d8df24423b89e6add781accc95 590ec11c220c40329b2c4f550d917773
#: 7a89763da6834bd0a66ee341229da738
msgid ""
"For performance specifications and basic product information, refer to the "
"respective model's `Product Brief "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/resources/product-information/product-briefs>`__."
" Industrial-series units can be purchased on the `VectorNav website "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/store/products>`__; for tactical-series "
"purchases, please contact sales@vectornav.com. For help integrating "
"VectorNav products with ArduPilot, please contact support@vectornav.com."
msgstr ""
"有关性能规格和基本产品信息，请参阅各型号的 `产品简介 <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/product-"
"information/product-briefs>`__。工业系列产品可在 `VectorNav 官网 "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/store/products>`__ 购买；战术系列产品请联系 "
"sales@vectornav.com。如需 VectorNav 产品与 ArduPilot 集成方面的帮助，请联系 "
"support@vectornav.com。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:28
#: 31b2baa6bc834f8182bb46a7e611cf4c 793b5bf07bb04e40893f2d6022ab469f
#: ac5691d4fd9c471d9b6aae44fc822a95 c61247cda42546b7a85aa2c0b3e4f115
#: e4ed884c531b43e8a437fc6890bdd327
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:31
#: 037efa58e32a4eaca96b3ebe9dfa018a 34f481dd3a764f0685059a6ed846374e
#: 51440807bed540c88183f0144f6e256a 64f65e073c184a1e9a061ffc07d4680c
#: deead97808d14b9183ffdd37f7650284
msgid "Wiring"
msgstr "接线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:32
#: 27fa09b541bc49de965d6e0fc7b7895b 343b65b6aa8b41cba8759f7fd50ab75d
#: 6285a9ffb9944decb4c272a9a159d229 acd3cb3c92b04dbd95bc1b72a3cb789b
#: f48f3da3ee7a4371be21e5daade7b4a6
msgid ""
"Connect any unused flight controller serial interface, such as a spare "
"**GPS** or **TELEM** port, to either available VectorNav **UART** port."
msgstr ""
"将飞控上任意未使用的串口（如备用 **GPS** 或 **TELEM** 端口）连接到 VectorNav 的任一可用 **UART** 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:35
#: 458b4ccc7a254df0a5db7a015834c67e 47426f5c11b142b68b2268b2b3bba1e9
#: 5619b9ab2a214560ab364681a672aba4 9a069f2f150d432d94d7581af79a9cb2
#: bfb4e5cd06c24e7a86aff11bc7c626ec
msgid ""
"VectorNav industrial-series (VN-X00) rugged units (non-SMD) use RS-232 "
"voltage levels on **UART1** and TTL voltage levels on **UART2**. As such, if"
" using one of those sensors it may be necessary to use VectorNav **UART2**."
msgstr ""
"VectorNav 工业系列（VN-X00）坚固型（非 SMD）设备在 **UART1** 上使用 RS-232 电压电平，在 **UART2** "
"上使用 TTL 电压电平。因此，如果使用这些传感器，可能需要使用 VectorNav 的 **UART2**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:37
#: 2bf9d830bdd44ad981ac022ef7e68f21 5d995976e949433f9c995a482918fe76
#: 6c56155a486445a88dc0dc409f30ec33 ae5ffe86655d462e8ab4473ff1069f9a
#: daad09ca8a8042bdbd26861bc192907c
msgid ""
"For any model-specific hardware requirements, see the relevant model's "
"`Datasheet <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/technical-"
"documentation/datasheets>`__."
msgstr ""
"有关特定型号的硬件要求，请参阅相应型号的 `数据手册 <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/technical-"
"documentation/datasheets>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:40
#: 2962a4b69db34797950c38dd7049bca7 7913c3ab3f554326aecb437e06a1c09b
#: 8a83fcc4849f47c994b10ac22fbcc413 c3685eaaa6cc43fd974893962dd93e47
#: c5f0357c0fa0468e99a7a9041ac0c40f
msgid "Mounting"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:41
#: 2dd5e96fd59a47fc9ee2f544c346c4b4 55ea3d91eb0e4461a6479fb994224bd6
#: 5d993f48804f4d26bf22b50e457a34b4 bc62471fc7c24bda9604a4fb9585a1f7
#: fbbda0404fa04a4495317a45293c8efa
msgid ""
"The VectorNav sensor can be mounted in any orientation, in any position on "
"the vehicle, without regard to center of gravity. All VectorNav sensors "
"default to a coordinate system of x-forward, y-right, and z-down, making the"
" default mounting as connector-back, base-down. This can be changed to any "
"rigid rotation using the VectorNav Reference Frame Rotation register."
msgstr ""
"VectorNav 传感器可以任意方向安装在飞行器的任意位置，无需考虑重心。所有 VectorNav 传感器默认坐标系为 X 轴朝前、Y 轴朝右、Z "
"轴朝下，默认安装方向为接头朝后、底面朝下。可通过 VectorNav 参考坐标系旋转寄存器将其更改为任意刚体旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:43
#: 2f75fa6e63db4a7aba77129e55a90f9e 4d78f9745fc0480d821fd542ad973f3f
#: 87cc0777fde54157a66b689e3eb61490 97d1093456664b0ea2c9adbb62ed6766
#: 9ed08649079c43c4a9f9c4abaabd494f
msgid ""
"If using a GNSS-enabled product, the GNSS antenna must be mounted rigidly "
"with respect to the inertial sensor and with an unobstructed sky view. If "
"using a dual-GNSS-enabled product (VN-3X0), the secondary antenna must be "
"mounted rigidly with respect to the primary antenna and the inertial sensor "
"with an unobstructed sky view."
msgstr ""
"如果使用具备 GNSS 功能的产品，GNSS 天线必须相对于惯性传感器刚性安装，且视野无遮挡。如果使用具备双 GNSS "
"功能的产品（VN-3X0），副天线必须相对于主天线和惯性传感器刚性安装，且视野无遮挡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:45
#: 6df0616f19d34e95ae36b4c80d6fef07 7dfeaf3b3669480ca2f6b07e5bf2d4f0
#: cbda3f940aee463fab91074a0d5c4f03 cee53de3c84e4ae084f639ffe29b5e12
#: df5b007038aa48e09f3c39401e070996
msgid ""
"For more mounting requirements and recommendations, see the relevant model's"
" `Quick Start Guide <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/technical-"
"documentation/quick-start-guides>`__ and `User Manual "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/resources/technical-documentation/user-"
"manuals>`__."
msgstr ""
"有关更多安装要求和建议，请参阅相应型号的 `快速入门指南 <https://www.vectornav.com/resources/technical-"
"documentation/quick-start-guides>`__ 和 `用户手册 "
"<https://www.vectornav.com/resources/technical-documentation/user-"
"manuals>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:48
#: 058a063f6b2c409f9578ff5d5fa41331 0eb731e5ed16419796ad548ee1db9e81
#: a3f55329415a4ebe83c6721f6fe3555d c1d4866729154cc99d15b6e04d7ecc10
#: d0f9a69c8c6d431cb4d0cbc54f74cb8b
msgid "Sensor Configuration"
msgstr "传感器配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:50
#: 1b7a778913124be6bff2faec6733e452 739f43dbe6e044ebaede6c446e6f7184
#: a3f1a7e10f274b9dbfe5d7e58b449828 b6942a7bc90f4293b5314594f2796c65
#: fb4ad30dc5f040439b5483656d348302
msgid ""
"Upon initialization, ArduPilot configures the VectorNav unit as follows:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 在初始化时按如下方式配置 VectorNav 单元："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:52
#: 15b55e38e59b4ebe9b6aa7c52621ba6d 1e03f514dcfb4d0e99b013178960aaf5
#: 3b3844e9d87e4658b497d915e842fcb1 d41f0803d3ec4b7cb9ea7a1372e008ef
#: f24d3a67844444c38394e7b9cf748744
msgid "Configures necessary binary outputs"
msgstr "配置必要的二进制输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:53
#: 65dde7b750e746498389011b26208d4d 7d3ad1827e294668b2faef2b9084910a
#: d8b56ac53225484e9939ea424ce7f2dc e44b027012e64f189adf0b806604068e
#: fac4e2fbb43a4406ad9cfa66ccc14d8a
msgid "Disables ASCII outputs on both serial ports"
msgstr "在两个串口上禁用 ASCII 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:55
#: 36f48de20c8348a6b8c45f088ac41935 4a958218badb4450bb19aa812ed1a213
#: 4ed3d8af21974613b6695a6d73ae7eb3 ca3cada5dd274ffb81cf80b85f5bbd40
#: ce310ecfa1b94e18b3243e46d5cddd5f
msgid ""
"All other necessary configuration parameters must be separately loaded to "
"the VectorNav unit manually."
msgstr "所有其他必要配置参数必须手动单独加载到 VectorNav 单元。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:57
#: 01edf0c745674e80a3c1afcc2914a176 13deec6c8d7342ba9447ceee33035c2a
#: 333d917703e0430f9f6300b279d1427e 757681dc7a6147eea3fbc669d4c2b454
#: 90c0bd48e97e41c184ed153f66c7f8c7
msgid ""
"``Baudrate``: Necessary if increasing the :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` "
"above a certain rate. The default baudrate of VectorNav sensors is 115200 "
"bps, but is recommended to increase the baudrate on the sensor to 921600 bps"
" and set :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` to 800Hz, if possible."
msgstr ""
"``Baudrate``：在将 :ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` 提高到一定速率以上时需要设置。VectorNav "
"传感器默认波特率为 115200bps，但建议将传感器波特率提高至 921600bps，并在可能的情况下将 "
":ref:`EAHRS_RATE<EAHRS_RATE>` 设置为 800Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:58
#: 49c732d9ad6f4b3a94fb4d81a1c6ebac 5f52504d5f444a6b90e61b7627b218e6
#: b3db9e1a4bee42458077c6cfb5536f45 d3c121ec5dea4b0c88daa858388cdded
#: ff9aa2dd2d4e4852b4aac8ad141c3c4e
msgid ""
"``Reference Frame Rotation``: Necessary if not mounted as connector-back, "
"base-down configuration."
msgstr "``Reference Frame Rotation``：在非接头朝后、底面朝下安装时需要设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:59
#: 0987358b03314e1195ed1bc834d4ad3e 7121efb8009e44bda4511c2affbf1177
#: add0318847b846b184b0aa7276123fb6 d29bc4a6123046638a391a3ee57c67e5
#: de9c2a448fe34890a8c5e1d18ef0fd80
msgid ""
"``GNSS Antenna A Offset``: Necessary if using a GNSS-enabled product and the"
" GNSS antenna is mounted more than 10 centimeters from the VectorNav unit."
msgstr ""
"``GNSS Antenna A Offset``：在使用具备 GNSS 功能的产品且 GNSS 天线距 VectorNav 单元超过 10cm "
"时需要设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-ahrs-vectornav.rst:60
#: 07562d0edf704ff09eb2885c827f3609 24b735d4772942d39dac8eb1da3c28b0
#: 2ea8dfd918e0495092ae0e51acfa291c 34487311030c4f0397a54aad7f308703
#: a91b0bb4e2aa4439862693bc6badd3bc
msgid ""
"``GNSS Antenna Baseline``: Necessary if using a dual-GNSS-enabled product."
